    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a third-person perspective Warriors and Action Game game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player takes the role of a drill alien and controls a dog to defeat the Antenna Aliens, a hostile force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies are attacked by the Antenna Aliens and animals controlled by the Antenna Aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the area, a boss character, a giant animal, awaits and attacks the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to defeat the hostile Antenna aliens and restore peace to the drill aliens?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a third-person perspective Warriors and Action Game game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player takes the role of a drill alien and controls a dog to defeat the Antenna Aliens, a hostile force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies are attacked by the Antenna Aliens and animals controlled by the Antenna Aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the area, a boss character, a giant animal, awaits and attacks the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to defeat the hostile Antenna aliens and restore peace to the drill aliens?</p>",
    "short_description": "It is a Warriors and Action Game from the Third Person Perspective. The player controls a dog as a drill alien and his objective is to defeat his enemy, the Antenna Alien. The Antenna aliens attack by controlling animals. Can you restore peace to the Drill Aliens?",
